{"status":"answered","model_status":"answered","answer":"Register with Disability Services as soon as possible; the Malaysia campus pages say a DSS adviser will then contact you to discuss your learning adjustments, and you will receive an email confirmation if you are eligible.","points":[{"text":"Register as early as possible, because the assessment process can take some time.","source_id":"all-disability-alternative-assessment#2","quote":"The assessment process can take some time, so it’s a good idea to register as early as possible.","doc":"all-disability-alternative-assessment","title":"Alternative assessment arrangements","section":"Eligibility","level":null,"campus":"all","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu/students/admin/assessments/alternative","verified":true,"reason":null},{"text":"Your registration must come from an independent qualified health professional, such as a Psychiatrist or General Practitioner, and must clearly state the condition, its impacts on your academic life, and recommended accommodations.","source_id":"my-disability-register#1","quote":"be from an independent qualified health professional who has experience in the relevant field","doc":"my-disability-register","title":"Register with Disability Services","section":"Register with Disability Services","level":null,"campus":"my","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu.my/student-services/support-services/disability-support/register-with-disability-services","verified":true,"reason":null},{"text":"A DSS adviser will contact you by email, phone or Zoom to discuss the adjustments you may need.","source_id":"my-disability-register#2","quote":"A DSS adviser will get in touch with you to talk about any adjustments you may need for your learning.","doc":"my-disability-register","title":"Register with Disability Services","section":"Register with Disability Services","level":null,"campus":"my","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu.my/student-services/support